^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@S is imperfect but there is nothing better that I see over the |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=negativedoubles,Negative Double^*N|CP||FP||at|. |
