nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|You can double if you have only one minor if you have spade support. But if West were intending to bid 4@S over 2@S then a better choice would have been 3@D or 3@H to start with as that is more consistent.|
