mb|1S|mb|P|SB|S|mb|2S|mb|3D?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Let me find out what should I bid with my hand. 3@S bid now is NOT invitational, it is competing. If I want to make a game try, I have to bid 3@H, which is totally artificial on this auction.|
PG| ***** 59 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Some people play something called a ^*BMaximal Double^*n where double might be a game try. However, on this hand, since partner bid diamonds, even if you ^*BMaximal Double^*n, it would be penalty.|
PG| ***** 60 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Now, let me use Bergen hand evaluation to count out my hand to figure out if I have a game try or not. I have 7 HCP. The @DQ is normally discounted, but because partner opened 1@D, I will only discount it one. The hand has two length points. So the hand is worth eight points before the Bergen declarer add ons. |
PG| ***** 61 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|For Bergen declarer add ons, I add two for singleton and one for side 4+ card suit. So my hand is now worth 11 points. Partner can have as much as 15 or a bad 16 points. So I probably should invite particularly because I have a likely 9 card fit. |
PG| ***** 62 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Further, if I chose not to invite, although it is possible partner raised on 3 spades, I still could make the |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=lott,Law of Total Tricks^*N|CP||FP||at| bid of 3@S with a likely 9 card fit.|
PG| ***** 63 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So I am sure 3@H is my best bid.|
PG| ***** 64 ***** |


mb|3H|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|4S|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I don't think 4@S is correct. North has 13 |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=dummypoints,Dummy Points^*N|CP||FP||at|. North's hand has 12 HCP, plus one for doubleton and one for honor quality heart suit. The total is 13 after you deduct one point for @DJ which is likely useless 13. So I don't think quite enough to bid 4, although close at IMPs--being vulnerable.|
PG| ***** 65 ***** |


